  "Scenes.Giacomo.WormRemovalOffer.HeChuckles": "[pg][say: Been playing with creatures best left alone, I see,] he chuckles, [say: Infestations of any kind are annoying, yet your plight is quite challenging, given the magnitude of corrupt creatures around here. It is not the first time I have seen one infested with THOSE worms.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Giacomo.WormRemovalOffer.HecklesLightly": "[say: Do not look at me as if I am a mystic.] Giacomo heckles lightly. [say: Your crotch is squirming.][pg]"
  "Scenes.Giacomo.WormRemovalOffer.HowHeKnows": "You ask how he knows of your change, and the merchant giggles heartily.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Giacomo.WormRemovalOffer.LookingDown": "Looking down, you realize how right he is and attempt to cover yourself in embarrassment.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Giacomo.WormRemovalOffer.NotEnoughGems": "You realize you don't have enough gems for such a pricey potion, but perhaps there is something else in his inventory you can buy."
  "Scenes.Giacomo.WormRemovalOffer.PurchaseCure": "Do you purchase his cure?"
  "Scenes.Giacomo.WormRemovalOffer.PurveyorJingles": "[say: Fear not!] the purveyor jingles. [say: I have something that will cure you of those little bastards. Of course, there is also a chance that it will purge your system in general. This potion is not cheap. I will trade it for [b:175 gems].][pg]"
}
